  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="win__inner reveal">
      <h2 class="win__title" id="win-title">
        The operator who isn't fooled twice.
      </h2>
      <p class="win__body">
        A year in, the building runs as one system. But that's not what you
        notice. What you notice is the quiet. No 2 a.m. call about a failed
        compressor. A capital plan you set, instead of one that ambushes you. A
        power bill you can predict to the dollar in a budget meeting.
      </p>
      <p class="win__body">
        When the next vendor walks in with a box and a brochure, you already
        know what your building needs, because someone finally did the exam.
        You're the operator nobody sells anymore. You're the one who decides.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

